safix::mapping_name_needs_target

  × 'ntfy-token' was read as a mapping name, and no target was named first.
  │ 
  │ A mapping name may follow clan or keepassxc on sync, never neither: a
  │ mapping id may be declared under both targets' namespaces, so guessing
  │ which one a bare name belongs to would be ambiguous exactly when it
  │ matters. Name a target first:
  │ 
  │     safix sync clan ntfy-token
  │     safix sync keepassxc ntfy-token
